<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-043" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage" source-id="s-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage-ws2400356">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p001:m0000" ref="s2k_e90_mxi">江斆</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p001:m0003" ref="s2k_e90_mxi">叔文</persName>，濟陽考城人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p001:m0014" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">湛</persName>，宋左光祿大夫、儀同三司。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">尚孝武女<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p002:m0004" ref="hx8_st4_jdd_G">臨汝公主</persName>，拜駙馬都尉。除著作郎，太子舍人，丹陽丞。時<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p002:m0030" ref="ez7_i28_72u">袁粲</persName>爲尹，見<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-jiangxiao-marriage:p002:m0036" ref="s2k_e90_mxi">斆</persName>歎曰：「風流不墜，政在江郎。」</p>
</text>
